  "body": "Brand new and completed in 2025, this double-storey residence in the heart of Glendowie has been thoughtfully designed to deliver effortless modern family living.\r\n\r\nOffering four generous bedrooms, 2.5 beautifully appointed bathrooms, and multiple living areas, the light-filled layout provides exceptional space and flexibility. At the heart of the home, the contemporary kitchen anchors everyday living and entertaining, while seamless indoor-outdoor flow creates the perfect setting for family gatherings and relaxed weekends. Internal-access garaging adds further practicality.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned within an easy stroll of Glendowie Primary, Glendowie College, and nearby parks and reserves, this sought-after location combines convenience with an outstanding family lifestyle. For added peace of mind, the home is covered by the balance of a 10-Year Stamford Building Warranty Insurance policy.\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, relocating, or simply seeking the ease of a brand-new home, this is a rare opportunity to secure quality, comfort, and contemporary living in one of Glendowie's most desirable neighbourhoods.",
